      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "waiting — conditional\nExact count waits for completion\nAn exact scalar result requires completion of its\nrelevant input; partial state does not prove early\nfinal output.\nAssumes operator profile datafusion-physical-7865139;\nproducer identity is unverified.\n\nretained-state — conditional\nCompact count state\nCOUNT keeps a fixed number of counters per aggregate\ninstance, independent of row count; this is not a\nquery memory bound.\nAssumes operator profile datafusion-physical-7865139;\nproducer identity is unverified.\n\ndecomposition — conditional\nPartial counts can combine\nCOUNT partial states can be combined under the\naggregate mode and integer count contract. No\narbitrary floating-point SUM reassociation is inferred.\nAssumes operator profile datafusion-physical-7865139;\nproducer identity is unverified.",
      "originalText": "waiting — conditional\nExact count waits for completion\nAn exact scalar result requires completion of its\nrelevant input; partial state does not prove early\nfinal output.\nAssumes operator profile datafusion-physical-7865139;\nproducer identity is unverified.\n\nretained-state — conditional\nCompact count state\nCOUNT keeps a fixed number of counters per aggregate\ninstance, independent of row count; this is not a\nquery memory bound.\nAssumes operator profile datafusion-physical-7865139;\nproducer identity is unverified.\n\ndecomposition — conditional\nPartial counts can combine\nCOUNT partial states can be combined under the\naggregate mode and integer count contract. No\narbitrary floating-point SUM reassociation is inferred.\nAssumes operator profile datafusion-physical-7865139;\nproducer identity is unverified.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17,
